    <string-array name="level_desc">
        <item>The page as its author made it: colours, animations, fonts, full images. Only the compatibility layers stay (modern TLS, CSS and JavaScript fixes) so it renders at all on this engine.</item>
        <item>The original look without ads, trackers and cookie pop-ups.</item>
        <item>Ads gone, images fitted to the screen, heavy embeds only on tap, no animations. Colours kept.</item>
        <item>Tuned for e-ink: everything in Balanced plus high-contrast text and grayscale images. The default.</item>
        <item>For weak devices and heavy pages: smaller images, no web fonts, sticky bars removed.</item>
        <item>Just text and links: no images, no JavaScript. Fastest and lightest.</item>
    </string-array>
